# (+0.719, +0.721) while flame6/flame8 settled the extended-axis question
# negatively and the rest of the neighborhood read flat. The strike5000
# refutation the same night says exactly what that consistency is worth:
# nothing until untouched seeds speak. Laws six and nine or no adoption.
